// Conformance fixture for ta.obv (S-bead OpenBBTechnical-0e9.5.28, Wave 5B-3).
//
// Author-derivative posture per PRD §7.3: reference output computed
// deterministically by running this script's OBV formula against a
// hard-coded synthetic close+volume series (see ta_obv.csv `close`/`volume`).
// OBV = cum(volume * sign(change(close))); bar 0 is NA because
// ta.change(close) is NA on the first bar.
//@version=6
indicator("smoke_ta_obv", overlay=false)
plot(ta.obv, title="obv")
